flowchart TB
    A[DLQ Message] --> B[Simulate Replay]
    B --> C[Schema Check]
    C --> D[Policy Check]
    D --> E[Idempotency Check]
    E --> F[Preview Receipt]
    F --> G{Execute Requested?}
    G -- No --> H[Stop: Simulation Complete]
    G -- Yes --> I{Approval?}
    I -- No --> H
    I -- Yes --> J[Execute Replay]
    J --> K[Replay Receipt + Card]
